---
import Manual from "../layouts/Manual.astro";
---

<Manual
  title=".secret — Venkat Sundaraneedi"
  description="You found it."
  manTitle="Secret"
  manNumber="7"
  sectionLabel="Games"
  tagline="You were not supposed to find this."
  noindex
>
  <Fragment slot="actions">
    <a class="action" href="/">cd ~</a>
    <a class="action" href="/writing">writing(7)</a>
  </Fragment>

  <section class="section" id="found">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="section-num">01</span>
      <h2>Found</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        You typed <code>cat .secret</code> somewhere and then actually tried <code>/secret</code> in
        the URL bar. That is the correct amount of curiosity.
      </p>
      <p>
        The developer thinks pineapple belongs on pizza. This is a hill he will die on. The
        terminal setup is real, the opinions are real, and the CV is still a placeholder.
      </p>
      <p>
        Open the browser console. There is ASCII art. There are also pages that are not in the
        index: <a href="/writing">writing(7)</a>, <a href="/guestbook">guestbook(8)</a>,
        <a href="/tools">tools(1)</a>, <a href="/contact">contact(1)</a>.
      </p>
      <p class="muted small">Classification: eyes only. Grader: none. No reward except this paragraph.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Manual>
